<title>BELARUS: SOCCER-BELARUS AND LATVIA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BELARUS AND LATVIA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus and Latvia drew 1-1 (halftime 0-1) in a World Cup European group four qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Latvia - Mikhail Zemlitsky (16th)</p>
<p>Belarus - Vladimir Makovsky (78th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
